---
// src/components/Main_RIDDLE.astro
---

<main class="app-page">
  <section class="section hero-section" id="overview">
    <div class="hero-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="section-content">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="hero-eyebrow">クイズ✖️SNSプラットフォーム</span>
          <h1 class="hero-title">Riddle</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            クイズ✖️SNSで、難問とコミュニティの両方から刺激を受ける新感覚の脳トレ体験。解いた瞬間を仲間と共有して盛り上がろう。
          </p>
          <div class="hero-meta">
            <span class="meta-chip">クイズ✖️SNS</span>
            <span class="meta-chip">ライブランキング</span>
            <span class="meta-chip">コミュニティ投稿</span>
          </div>
          <div class="store-buttons">
            <a
              href="https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/riddle/id1621658101"
              class="store-button store-button--app-store"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              <img
                src="/Download_on_the_App_Store_Badge_JP_RGB_blk_100317.svg"
                alt="App Storeでダウンロード"
                class="store-badge"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.higuchiyuya.riddle"
              class="store-button store-button--google"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              <img
                src="/GetItOnGooglePlay_Badge_Web_color_Japanese.png"
                alt="Google Playで入手"
                class="store-badge"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#features" class="primary-action">主な機能を見る</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="ghost-action">お問い合わせ</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="glass-panel">
            <div class="panel-accent"></div>
            <img
              src="/RiddleLogo.png"
              alt="Riddle app visual"
              class="hero-image"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section apps-section" id="features">
    <div class="hero-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="section-content">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="apps-title">Riddleで鍛える3つの力</h2>
        <p class="apps-subtitle">
          多彩なジャンルと難易度で、飽きることなく脳をストレッチ。毎日の隙間時間を、知的なトレーニングに変えます。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article
          class="feature-card"
          style="--accent: var(--color-riddle); --accent-glow: var(--color-riddle-glow);"
        >
          <span class="feature-icon">🧩</span>
          <h3>豊富なパズルライブラリ</h3>
          <p>
            ロジック、数学、言語など、多面的に思考を刺激する問題を収録。アップデートで新問題も続々追加。
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="feature-card"
          style="--accent: var(--color-riddle); --accent-glow: var(--color-riddle-glow);"
        >
          <span class="feature-icon">🎯</span>
          <h3>段階的な難易度</h3>
          <p>
            初級から上級まで細かなレベル設定。自分のペースに合わせてステップアップできます。
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="feature-card"
          style="--accent: var(--color-riddle); --accent-glow: var(--color-riddle-glow);"
        >
          <span class="feature-icon">📊</span>
          <h3>成長を可視化</h3>
          <p>
            正答率や挑戦履歴を記録し、得意・苦手を分析。振り返りで次のゴールが明確になります。
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="feature-card"
          style="--accent: var(--color-riddle); --accent-glow: var(--color-riddle-glow);"
        >
          <span class="feature-icon">🔥</span>
          <h3>コミュニティタイムライン</h3>
          <p>
            解答のひらめきや感想を投稿してSNSのように交流。お気に入りユーザーの挑戦もタイムラインでチェックできます。
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section highlight-section" id="community">
    <div class="hero-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="section-content">
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-badge">Quiz ✖️ Social</div>
        <h2 class="contact-title">自分に合ったスタイルで継続できる</h2>
        <p class="contact-description">
          短時間でも気軽に挑戦でき、SNSの盛り上がりが継続のモチベーションに。通勤や休憩時間に仲間と同じ問題で盛り上がれます。
        </p>
        <ul
          class="feature-list"
          style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; text-align: left;"
        >
          <li
            style="position: relative; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"
          >
            カテゴリ別の問題で苦手分野を重点強化
          </li>
          <li
            style="position: relative; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"
          >
            タイムラインでひらめきを共有しヒントを得られる
          </li>
          <li
            style="position: relative; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"
          >
            ランキングで全国のユーザーと記録を競える
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="plan-actions">
          <a
            href="https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/riddle/id1621658101"
            class="cta-button primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">今すぐプレイ</a
          >
          <a
            href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.higuchiyuya.riddle"
            class="cta-button secondary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Playでみる</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section contact-section">
    <div class="hero-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="section-content">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 class="contact-title">ひらめきと論理を磨く毎日を</h2>
        <p class="contact-description">
          Riddleがあれば、いつでもどこでも頭のストレッチ。新しい発想が必要なとき、ひとつの謎解きが突破口になります。
        </p>
        <div class="contact-actions">
          <a
            href="https://apps.apple.com/jp/app/riddle/id1621658101"
            class="cta-button primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">App Storeでダウンロード</a
          >
          <a
            href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.higuchiyuya.riddle"
            class="cta-button secondary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Playで入手</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<style>
  .app-page {
    background: var(--bg-body);
    color: var(--text-main);
    transition:
      background-color 0.4s ease,
      color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .section-content {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-section {
    padding-top: 140px;
    background: var(--bg-body);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-riddle);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    background: var(--title-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .meta-chip {
    padding: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--panel-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .store-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .store-badge {
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* Buttons from HOME theme */
  .primary-action,
  .cta-button.primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--text-main);
    color: var(--bg-body);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .primary-action:hover,
  .cta-button.primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .ghost-action,
  .cta-button.secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-main);
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ghost-action:hover,
  .cta-button.secondary:hover {
    background: var(--card-hover-bg);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--text-main);
  }

  /* Apps Section styling from HOME */
  .apps-section {
    background: var(--bg-body);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .apps-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: var(--title-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .apps-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--panel-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    background: var(--card-hover-bg);
    border-color: var(--accent, var(--color-riddle));
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px var(--accent-glow, var(--color-riddle-glow));
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Highlight Section */
  .highlight-section {
    background: var(--bg-body);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .plan-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 32px;
    padding: 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
  }

  .plan-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--color-riddle-glow);
    color: var(--color-riddle);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Contact Section style from HOME */
  .contact-section {
    background: var(--contact-bg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: 34px;
    padding: 4rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .contact-card {
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .contact-title {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: var(--title-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .contact-description {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Hero Visual & Glass Panel */
  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .glass-panel {
    position: relative;
    width: 320px;
    aspect-ratio: 9/16;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    backdrop-filter: var(--glass-blur);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .panel-accent {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at top right,
      var(--color-riddle-glow),
      transparent
    );
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero-image {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-copy,
    .hero-meta,
    .store-buttons,
    .hero-actions {
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .section {
      padding: 4rem 1rem;
    }
    .plan-card,
    .contact-card {
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .contact-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .plan-actions,
    .contact-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
